Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.11,0:25:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧  没事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.72,0:25:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我去准备了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.25,0:26:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗  好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.50,0:26:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.14,0:27:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,忍不住了吧
